; Customer parts. Every part is a full 32x48 canvas with identical anchoring: feet on row 47, waist (counter
; line) on row 34, head centred on x=16. Layer order: body, head, hair, accessory. _0/_1 are the idle-bob frames
; (bodies keep their feet, heads and hair drop 1px; the goat flicks an ear; the lantern flickers).
; Palette swap (shaders/palette_swap.gdshader) may remap ONLY these indices, per part:
;   cloth A (bodies, witch hat): e f g        cloth B (trim, belts, hat bands, trousers): i j k
;   hair (hair parts): 1 2 3                   skin (hands on bodies): r s -> the head's (main, shade) pair
; Head skin pairs (main, shade): head_round r,s; head_long s,t; head_square t,2.
; Everything else (outline 0, iron 7 8 9, apron 6 9, boots, goat, lantern) is fixed.

